<p>				    (2.62)	   0.01	  (0.67)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding    23,313,243   24,710,423    21,904,213</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 year results include a non-recurring charges and adjustments of $2.62 per share primarily attributed to the restructuring of M4 Environmental LP, the limited partnership between Molten and Lockheed Martin Corp.</p>
